      en: ["The monastery was originally built in the 4th century.", "Located 15 km south of Bakhdida.", "Main church features 5th-century mosaics.", "Monastery complex covers 5,000 m².", "Looted by ISIS fighters in 2014.", "Cloister has columns with Corinthian capitals."],
