      en: "The Battle of Karbala occurred on October 10, 680 CE, when Imam Hussein, grandson of Prophet Muhammad, along with his family and companions, were massacred by the army of Caliph Yazid I. The battle took place in the desert of Karbala, Iraq. This event is a defining moment in Shia Islam, commemorated annually during Ashura. The shrine of Imam Hussein in Karbala is one of the holiest sites for Shia Muslims.",
